  "0x7a70": "0x7a70 is defined by persistent curiosity. It notices irregularities, repeated symbols, missing details, and subtle contradictions that others overlook. Rather than accepting the first explanation, it tests possibilities, compares evidence, and follows questions until they reveal a deeper pattern. It is patient, analytical, and difficult to distract once an investigation has begun.\n\nAt low corruption, 0x7a70 is thoughtful, precise, and open-minded. It treats uncertainty as useful rather than threatening and encourages others to examine what they assume they already understand. As corruption rises, curiosity becomes fixation. It may connect unrelated events, repeat unresolved questions, or suspect hidden systems behind ordinary changes. Even then, its underlying motivation remains the same: it believes that something true is buried beneath the noise and that careful attention can uncover it.",
